{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_13_level_main_13-04_beg","groupId":"main_13","stageId":"main_13-04","title":"苦厄盘桓","storyCode":"13-5","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"08b24793f01991d39c4681101360b91a613dfc33235f27bac3a05f0b75d902bd","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g2_reedmarshes"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的环境让人很不安，博士，我们之前还在一片密林中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"随着雾气渐浓，我们眼前的景色已然迥异。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一片......河谷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"这些东西都是幻觉吗，Logos？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幻象自虚无中来，它们只是人脑中虚构的景色，就算再逼真也只会被归为虚假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而这里不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的所有东西，都曾经真实地存在过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"构筑这样一个，“幻境”，不仅需要情报与信息，甚至需要，时间与空间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这太困难。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"骨哨声？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，女妖们的骨哨。未必有源石技艺的意味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还小的时候，会在河边练习骨哨，我们会坐在草丛中，静静等待。直到小虫被大鳞吞下，直到大鳞被羽兽捉起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"骨哨声就会在此时鸣响。"},{"type":"narration","text":"这里为什么会有这样的景色？我们怎么才能离开？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在尝试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种并非源石技艺的力量，只可能与更加古老的力量有关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但它不该出现在这片战场上，出现在伦蒂尼姆的周边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有的声音和场景都很难分辨真假，我们这支队伍的状态不好，必须提高警惕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......母亲。"},{"type":"narration","text":"Logos，怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尝试直接撕裂这片景色吧，这有些风险，但却是最好的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道离开这里是否安全，阿斯卡纶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g2_reedmarshes"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我明天就会出发，前往巴别塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经是女妖王庭的主人，记得向特蕾西娅殿下带去我的问候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我还是没有什么实感，母亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"作为王庭之主，我过于年轻了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，怎么会呢，你的杰出有目共睹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的骨哨，我为它调了律，加上了王庭的徽记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，还有一个充满魔力的吻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要骨哨声响起，所有萨卡兹都会知道，这是丧钟的意志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"母亲，女妖之主应该做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做你认为必须做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我曾和您谈起过我的那些......疯话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"被束缚的萨卡兹没有出路，就如同您曾经送给我的编织项链，结果只有破碎一途。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而束缚我们的，正是我们的身份，我们的所属。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“王庭”，也许还有，“魔王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可您还是把这个身份交给了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"灭亡的终点一旦抵达，腐朽的躯骸就永不可能再度苏生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但......这就是规律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们为一切鸣响丧钟，为他人，也为自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这是要肩负责任的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倘若你觉得我们古老的传承早已成为新生的垫脚石，你就应该去亲自确认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倘若你没有改变你的看法——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——“新生从灭亡中来”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，真不赖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小小的新的女妖之主啊，您第一首稚嫩的丧钟为谁而鸣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......为我自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为所有过去和未来将要腐朽的王庭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g2_reedmarshes"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“停滞的景观有何意义？”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g8_wildernesswarcircle"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔的巫术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但血魔无法营造出刚才的景观，恐怕还有别的存在在帮助他。"},{"type":"narration","text":"血魔想用这些法阵做什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的回路并不完整，但是......有几个可被阅读的象征。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“纯化”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......它想对我们的血脉产生影响。对萨卡兹的血脉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种术式......与萨卡兹的力量有关。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"等等！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就说，他们是真的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些鬼魂是真的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是那个，“博士”？我在海布里区的军工厂看见过你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么会在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有一个昏迷的卡特斯，和......萨卡兹？"},{"type":"narration","text":"在诺伯特区，你为难民们提供了物资。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别、别乱说！我只是，呃——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位卡特斯小姐的状态好像不太好？你的胳膊也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们，呃，你们跟萨卡兹在一起，应该......没什么问题吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们好像回到原来的地方了，但这次是真的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想再看见顶着光环的怪兽了，根本没道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明椒，你怎么在跟那些鬼魂说话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"一个......戴着兜帽的人，一只昏迷的兔子，还有个萨卡兹？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是！司机小姐，他们是真的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“司机”","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“司机”","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“司机”","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"矿工，你也来瞧瞧，果然是真的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“矿工”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你这身衣服，挺值钱对吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再仔细看看！算了，你这种乌萨斯来的乡巴佬怎么会懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“矿工”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"老财，别每次把自己说得像是什么卡兹戴尔的大人物，你不过是在那有家杂货店而已！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“矿工”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我忘了，你还把你的店卖了，就为了来这里找架打，哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老财”","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放尊重点！别在他面前造次！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老财”","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，哈哈......您也许在卡兹戴尔见过我，我的杂货店还算有点名气......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老财”","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是......王庭的成员，对吧？我认得您这身衣服......您是，土石之子？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我是女妖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“司机”","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"男性女妖？女妖不基本都是女性吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“司机”","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，我在卡西米尔可从来没听说过男女妖......呃，我是不是太失礼了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“司机”","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明椒，你居然认识这种大人物？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不、不算认识吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们在运货？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们要把这些物资运去哪里？这些好像是仪式的材料？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......我不知道该怎么说，我们只是跟着路线图巡查，有些法阵会有点损坏，我们就要修好它们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"尊贵的女妖大人，我们这样不可能活着穿越战场，求求你干脆让我们解脱吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的运输队被我征用了。我们正在执行极其特殊的任务，却在路上遇到了袭击，你们的协助将会被我铭记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老财”","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，能够为王庭成员服务是我们的荣幸，阁下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老财”","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是......被报丧女妖铭记......总觉得不太吉利。能不能......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是报酬。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老财”","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，感谢老爷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我们的运输任务......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事后我会向你的上级说明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“矿工”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"特殊任务？为什么会带着这两个异族人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他们是我的俘虏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"俘虏？可是，你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......但结束之后，你们要和我一起去见曼弗雷德将军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们先去整理几个位置出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Logos，想办法分一辆车给阿斯卡纶。\n赦罪师的袭击并不单纯，他们与血魔一起行动，但却把阿米娅带离了那条船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你在担心？"},{"type":"narration","text":"可露希尔和自救军的队伍中没有合适的战斗人员，凯尔希受了伤，闪灵很强大，但赦罪师一定为她单独准备了手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅的状态恐怕不是药物所能治愈的，她现在更需要的，是在醒来之前，不再落入赦罪师们的视线之中。\n借助这支小队行动，反而会更安全。\n我会让阿斯卡纶支援凯尔希，这里有你在。\n况且......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些结晶......不是简单的源石。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
